{
  "message": "📋 Before I shape the PRD, give me the product-owner brain dump in your own words. What must this two-day MVP prove in a live demo, what would make it a failure, and is there anything else I should account for beyond the three documents already read? You can also invoke `bmad-party-mode` for multiple perspectives or `bmad-advanced-elicitation` for deeper exploration of a specific section.",
  "requestedSchema": {
    "properties": {
      "brain_dump": {
        "type": "string",
        "title": "Your product-owner view",
        "description": "Free-form context: the must-prove outcome, failure conditions, and any missing context."
      }
    }
  }
}

{
  "message": "Two calibration points before we draft: this is an internal operational tool and an evaluated assignment/demo, so I recommend a focused internal-tool PRD. Also, you mentioned both a “two-day MVP” and keeping a “four-day scope” realistic; I need the governing boundary. Which working mode and timebox should I use?",
  "requestedSchema": {
    "properties": {
      "stakes": {
        "type": "string",
        "title": "Stakes",
        "oneOf": [
          {
            "const": "internal_assignment",
            "title": "Internal tool + evaluated assignment/demo (recommended)"
          },
          {
            "const": "launch",
            "title": "Production launch"
          },
          {
            "const": "other",
            "title": "Other"
          }
        ],
        "default": "internal_assignment"
      },
      "working_mode": {
        "type": "string",
        "title": "Working mode",
        "oneOf": [
          {
            "const": "fast",
            "title": "Fast path — batch gaps, draft full PRD, then iterate"
          },
          {
            "const": "coaching",
            "title": "Coaching path — walk through vision/features and decisions"
          }
        ],
        "default": "fast"
      },
      "timebox": {
        "type": "string",
        "title": "Scope boundary",
        "oneOf": [
          {
            "const": "two_day_build",
            "title": "Two-day implementation MVP; four days is the overall assignment/deadline context"
          },
          {
            "const": "four_day_build",
            "title": "Four-day implementation scope; “two-day MVP” means the smallest subset"
          },
          {
            "const": "other",
            "title": "Other"
          }
        ],
        "default": "two_day_build"
      }
    }
  }
}

{
  "message": "Fast-path gap check — please confirm or correct these assumptions in one pass. I’ll tag anything you leave unresolved as `[ASSUMPTION]` and keep it out of the two-day MVP where it is not safe.",
